  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Natural Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean at Sephora</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Long-wearing</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ allure 2023 Best of Beauty Award Winner</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><b>What it is: </b>A long wear, ultraprecise, one millimeter pencil for the tiniest hair-like details and a clean, soft natural look. <br><br><b>Ingredient Callouts:</b> This product is vegan, gluten-free, and cruelty-free.<br><br><b>What Else You Need to Know:</b> Flick the tiny tip for a feathery, natural-looking effect.  The perfect amount of pigment and waxiness means it’s just firm enough for hair-like strokes that stay put. Ideal for the smallest sparse patches, adding realistic details and dimension. This formula is clean, vegan, and hypoallergenic.<br><br><b>Clinical Results:</b> In a consumer study of 30 people applying Brow Pop Nano, after 7 days:<br>- 100% agreed they would purchase Brow Pop Nano and recommend it to a friend<br>- 100% agreed that Brow Pop Na</div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Using the spoolie, brush brows up to groom.<br>-Twist up nano tip until just visible. <br>-Without pressing hard, use a gentle flicking motion to softly detail and add dimension. <br><br>Hot Tip: <br>-For larger areas, start with Kosas&rsquo;s Brow Pop Dual-Action (sold separately) to fill and shape.<br>-Layer Kosas&rsquo; Air Brow Tinted gel and/or Air Brow Clear gel (both sold separately) over pencil for the full Kosas brow look (peak tint, volume, and hold).</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Hydrogenated Coco-Glycerides, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Zinc Stearate, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Synthetic Japan Wax, Mica, Palmitic Acid, Stearic Acid, Triethoxycaprylylsilane, Polyhydroxystearic Acid, Tocopherol, Lecithin, Ethylhexyl Palmitate, Isostearic Acid, Isopropyl Myristate, Polyglyceryl-3 Polyricinoleate, Water, Glyceryl Caprylate, Caprylyl Glycol [May Contain (+/-): Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891)]..<br><br><i>The list of ingredients is subject to change, please consult the packaging of the product purchased.</i></div></details>",
